### Phase 20 Account Governance Smoke Tests
### Replace placeholders before execution.

@apiBase=http://localhost:4000
@adminToken=REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
@providerToken=REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@patientId=REPLACE_WITH_PATIENT_ID
@providerId=REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_ID
@organizationId=REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZATION_ID

### Admin: list patients
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: list providers
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: list organizations
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create organization
POST {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phase 20 Smoke Test Organization"
}

### Admin: update organization
PUT {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/organizations/{{organizationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phase 20 Smoke Test Organization Updated"
}

### Admin: account audit filtered by patient
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/audit?accountType=PATIENT&patientId={{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: account audit filtered by provider
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/audit?accountType=PROVIDER&providerId={{providerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: audit export
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/audit/export?accountType=PROVIDER&providerId={{providerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: governance summary
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/governance-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: data quality report
GET {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/data-quality
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: credential governance sweep preview
POST {{apiBase}}/api/admin/users/credential-governance/sweep
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "previewOnly": true,
  "expiringSoonDays": 30,
  "reviewTaskDueDays": 7,
  "providerLimit": 25,
  "markExpiredDocuments": true,
  "createReviewTasks": true,
  "queueReminders": false
}

### Provider: logout
POST {{apiBase}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
